1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,875
How are requirements collected?

2
00:00:01,875 --> 00:00:04,361
Interviews go deep but are slow.

3
00:00:04,361 --> 00:00:06,992
Questionnaires reach many people cheaply.

4
00:00:06,992 --> 00:00:09,817
Observation shows what people really do.

5
00:00:09,817 --> 00:00:12,122
Documents show the real data.

6
00:00:12,122 --> 00:00:18,802
And prototypes let users react to a screen, which they are much better at than describing what they want.

7
00:00:18,802 --> 00:00:30,182
The results go into the SRS, where every requirement must be testable: the system should be fast is useless; a receipt shall print within five seconds can be checked.

